тливая Коллекция Карта 056","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a1/Card_TMGC01-056.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251009014643"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Shykutchi_sprite_HKT_bow.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b2/Shykutchi_sprite_HKT_bow.png/revision/latest?cb=20240411023232","caption":"С бантиком (Hello Kitty Tamagotchi)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Shykutchi_Paradise_Field_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/35/Shykutchi_Paradise_Field_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20260710145634","caption":"Вид на поле в Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RacetoPull_LabTama_minigame_Tamagotchi_Paradise.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/17/RacetoPull_LabTama_minigame_Tamagotchi_Paradise.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20260619152923","caption":"RacetoPull LabTama minigame Tamagotchi Paradise.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/17/RacetoPull_LabTama_minigame_Tamagotchi_Paradise.png/revision/latest?cb=20260619152923"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/93/934a750a462bdfbcd8f1.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiUni_lanyard_black.jpg","caption":"Уникальный черный ремешок Tamagotchi Uni"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/c6/c6e13c3193a0e701bb9f.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:WorldTamaTourRainbowArcSticker.png","caption":"Наклейка World Tama Tour"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ToysRUsUniSticker.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/ae/ToysRUsUniSticker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20231011033220","caption":"Игрушки R Us Tama","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/ae/ToysRUsUniSticker.png/revision/latest?cb=20231011033220"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/84/84b1a751366db66486